sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as mlflow-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant Helm as Helm Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Helm: Flow 1: MLflow CR Reconciliation
        User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MLflow CR
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event (MLflow CR)<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        Operator->>Helm: Render chart with CR values
        Helm-->>Operator: Kubernetes manifests
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply resources<br/>(Deployment, Service, PVC,<br/>CronJobs, NetworkPolicy, SA)<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resource status
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ConsoleLink<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Update MLflow CR status<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over User,MLflow: Flow 2: MLflow Ingress via Gateway API
        User->>Gateway: POST /mlflow-{name}/*<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Platform auth
        Gateway->>MLflow: Forward via HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS (service-ca)
        MLflow-->>Gateway: Response
        Gateway-->>User: Response
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over K8sAPI,Operator: Flow 3: Namespace RBAC Propagation
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Namespace label change /<br/>Auth CR change (watch)
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Read Auth CR<br/>(workspace group subjects)
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Auth config
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RoleBindings<br/>in labeled namespaces<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    end
